{"id":12713,"title":"80 | CAT 生产部署实践","content":"CAT 生产部署应遵循从小规模实验起步、逐步扩容的落地策略。最小高可用集群建议由两台物理机作为 Collector 构成，单机强劲配置亦可支撑上千应用接入，但双机可确保故障备份。架构中需独立部署告警机与报表机，前者负责实时告警，后者承担跨小时至日级的数据聚合，两者均建议使用虚拟机。数据存储方面，MySQL 满足基础需求；若需长期保留调用链数据（数周至数月），推荐对接 HDFS 集群，短期存储则可直接利用本地磁盘。硬件配置上，Collector 对计算与内存要求较高，参考标准为 32 核 CPU、64G 内存及大容量 SSD，操作系统可选 CentOS 7。JVM 调优至关重要，针对大内存场景推荐使用 G1 垃圾收集器，并将堆内存设置为 50G 左右以支撑高频分钟级与小时级聚合计算。该方案兼顾了高性能处理与存储灵活性，为企业级监控系统的稳定运行提供了标准化实践路径。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":23988,"user_name":"天天平安","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1119208,"ip_address":"","ucode":"C4850F9655F4DD","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/13/e8/08b829a9.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1536742141,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":9649,"content":"谢谢反馈🌹后继增加生产实践环节","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"杨波","uid":1030344,"ctime":1537682208,"ip_address":"","comment_id":23988,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100007001,"comment_content":"CAT 这系列比前面的好很多，讲了很多的的实际生产经验。希望后面推出的课程也一样。","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1030344,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/b8/c8/c94d38a7.jpg","nickname":"杨波","note":"","ucode":"FA3418BB703BCA","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":423800,"discussion_content":"谢谢反馈🌹后继增加生产实践环节","content_length":15,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1537682208,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":51654,"user_name":"王盛武","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1182516,"ip_address":"","ucode":"DE7EF246D3DCE8","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12